    {
      "description": "We have a bunch of old magazines, mostly Life from 1953 and 1954. I remember seeing Madeline in one of them. I began searching with the help of ChatGPT.  There were several possibilities:\n\n* The full story of Madeline appeared in Life magazine and as a book in 1939.\n* Madeline's Rescue, Good Housekeeping, 1951\n* Madeline's Christmas, McCall's, Dec. 1956, has a special Christmas insert\n* Madeline in London, Holiday, Aug. 1963\n\nI found Madeline in London. The whole story is there. Several small color book pages per six magazine pages.  This picture is one of the pages.",
